\p Then¦376996 he¦377008 said¦377008 to¦377009 Yehoshua, “Listen, I've¦377011 \add ≈taken¦377011 away¦377011 the¦377005 guilt¦377013 of your¦377013 disobedience\add*, and¦376996 I'll¦377014 dress¦377014 you¦377015 in nice clothes.”
\p
