\p
\v 1 Then¦377148 the¦377149 messenger¦377149 who¦377150 was¦377150 talking¦377150 with¦377151 me turned¦377148 and¦377152 woke me¦377152 as¦377153 if waking someone from¦377157 their sleep¦377157.
\v 2 “What¦377161 do you¦377162 see¦377166?” he¦377159 \add ≈asked\add* me¦377160.
