\v 7 What are¦377255 you¦377255, big¦377258 mountain¦377256? Before¦377259 Zerubavel¦377260 you will become a plain¦377261. Then he¦377262 will¦377262 bring¦377262 out the¦377258 top¦377266 stone¦377265 to shouts¦377267 of¦377259 ‘Grace¦377268, grace¦377269 to¦377270 it¦377270.’ ”
