\v 8 Then Yahweh's¦377276 message¦377274 \add came\add* to¦377277 me¦377277, saying¦377278,
\v 9 “Zerubavel's¦377281 hands have¦377282 laid the¦377283 foundation¦377282 of¦377285 this¦377284 \add ≈temple¦377283\add* and¦377285 his¦377285 hands will bring it to completion.” Then you will \add ≈have confirmation¦377282\add* that¦377284 Commander-in-chief Yahweh¦377290 has¦377292 sent¦377292 me¦377292 to¦377293 you.
