\v 4 Commander-in-chief Yahweh¦377431 declares¦377430: I will send¦377429 it¦377429 out¦377429 so it¦377433 will¦377433 enter¦377433 into¦377434 the¦377436 house¦377436 of¦377436 \add ≈any\add* thief¦377437 and¦377438 into¦377438 the¦377440 house¦377440 of¦377440 anyone¦377441 who¦377441 \add ≈testified falsely¦377443 using\add* my¦377442 name¦377442, and it will remain in¦377442 that house and \add ≈eat away at¦377442\add* its timber¦377450 and its stones¦377453.”
