\v 5 Then¦377455 the¦377456 messenger¦377456 who'd been¦377457 talking¦377457 with¦377458 me \add ≈came¦377455 over¦377455\add* and¦377459 said¦377459 to¦377460 me¦377460, “\add ≈Look¦377464 up¦377461\add* and¦377464 see¦377464 what's¦377465 coming¦377466 now.”
