\v 6 “What¦377470 is¦377472 it¦377472?” I \add ≈asked¦377469\add*.
\p And¦377473 he said¦377473, “That's the¦377475 measuring bin¦377475 that's¦377476 coming¦377476.” Then¦377469 he \add ≈continued¦377473\add*, “That's¦377476 their¦377479 eye¦377479\f + \fr 5:6 \ft Some ancient translations have ‘iniquity’ here, but we've stayed with the Hebrew.\f* across the whole¦377480 land¦377482.”
