\v 7 Then¦377484, wow, a lead¦377486 covering¦377485 was¦377487 lifted¦377487 off and¦377488 there was¦377489 a woman¦377489 sitting¦377491 inside the¦377492 measuring bin.
\v 8 He¦377495 said¦377495, “This¦377496 \add >woman¦377496\add* is¦377497 ‘wickedness¦377497’.” Then¦377495 he¦377498 \add ≈pushed\add* her¦377499 \add back\add* inside¦377502 the measuring bin, then¦377495 \add quickly\add* pressed¦377504 the \add ≈heavy\add* lead¦377508 \add cover back\add* over its¦377511 opening.
\p
\v 9 Then I \add ≈looked¦377516 up\add* \add again\add* and wow, I saw¦377516 two¦377518 women¦377519 with¦377522 wings like¦377525 stork's¦377526 wings, flying on¦377522 the wind towards us, and¦377523 they¦377523 lifted¦377527 the measuring bin up \add ≈into\add* the sky¦377534.
