\v 11 “To¦377550 build¦377551 a temple¦377554 for¦377553 it¦377553 in¦377555 \add ≈Babylonia¦377556\add*,” he¦377549 \add ≈replied¦377549\add*. “And¦377557 when it's¦377557 ready¦377557, it'll¦377557 be¦377557 set¦377557 on¦377560 a base there¦377559.”
